I am in my kitchen.
I open the cupboards.
There is no food in the cupboards.
I look in the fridge.
There is no food there.
I want a good dinner tonight.
I like home-cooked food.
I take a paper and pen.
I write a shopping list.
I want rice.
I want vegetables too.
I like tomatoes.
I like onions too.
I write all this on the paper.
My list is ready.
I take my cloth bag.
I go to the shop.
